["pc","dkdd"],["pg",""],["hs","esss"],["At","If East returns a spade, South can win the @SA, "],["pg",""],["ls","esss"],["pc","stsas7s"],["pg",""],["hs","ndsd"],["at","unblock the @DJ, "],["pg",""],["ls","ndsd"],["pc","dddd"],["pg",""],["hs","nhsh"],["at","and cross to the dummy in hearts. "],["pg",""],["ls","nhsh"],["pc","hchc"],["pg",""],["hs","ndss"],["at","Dummy's 2 diamond winners can then be used to discard South's 2 spade losers. "],["pg",""],["up","15"],["ls","nd"],["ls","ss"],["md","0,dk,,sk"],["hs","sdwd"],["nt","If West was dealt the @DK, he will take South's @DJ. "],["pg",""],["ls","sdwd"],["pc","ddjdk"],["pg",""],["hs","esss"],["at","However, South can now be certain that East was dealt the @SK and he can finesse in that suit in order to make the contract. "],["pg",""],["md","0,sk,,d7"],["ls","es"],["hs","ws"],["at","If West was dealt the @SK in addition to the @CA, @CK, and @DK that he has already played, he certainly would have opened the bidding. "],["",""]]}}